      "id": "claim_b82da3af631144cdbc4c7d7a7bd622a0",
      "statement": "Known quirk: the success path computes syncStatus as `syncLogs.length > 0 ? 'SYNCHRONIZED' : 'SYNCHRONIZED'`, so both branches return the same string; the only reachable values are 'SYNCHRONIZED' (any successful query, including zero rows) and 'OFFLINE' from the catch handler, and 'PENDING' — though allowed by the ChangelogResponse type — is never produced.",
