      "statement": "On a Prisma failure the route logs and returns HTTP 200 with success: true, the same curated array, syncStatus 'OFFLINE', empty syncRecords and a fresh lastSyncedAt; it never emits success: false, so a database outage cannot drive the client's apiFetch into its error branch.",
